{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-crew#feature-terminal-panes","repo":"dshworks/dsh-crew","commit":"13b0fdfd0503c29ada9647d3b2f0cb1c4c40ea99","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-crew 的功能「交互式终端面板」：在 Crew 标签页选择可用 agent 后，会在当前 DSH 会话工作区启动 PTY，并把实时终端画面显示在面板中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/crew-view.js:122-147","lib/panes.js:172-211"]}
{"unit_id":"dshworks__dsh-crew#feature-agent-tools","repo":"dshworks/dsh-crew","commit":"13b0fdfd0503c29ada9647d3b2f0cb1c4c40ea99","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-crew 的功能「agent 工具委派」：DSH agent 可用 crew_list、crew_seat 和 crew_send 查看成员、启动面板并发送任务；crew_send 等待屏幕稳定后返回新增输出。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:259-285","lib/tools.js:287-338","lib/tools.js:343-355","lib/tools.js:420-431"]}
